    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash into action with Vector Strike, a competitive experience that blends precision shooting and an infinite skill cap with tense sports gameplay. It\u2019s easy to pick up but endlessly rewarding to master. Teamwork &amp; strategy reign supreme, so grab your squad &amp; score some goals.\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist &amp; join us on our Early Access journey to help shape the future of Vector Strike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/f8efc2623ee325106992405343be3215.webp?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/1a3cddf17c217a9bbdd01a69f364e257.poster.avif?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/1a3cddf17c217a9bbdd01a69f364e257.webm?t=1754224654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/1a3cddf17c217a9bbdd01a69f364e257.mp4?t=1754224654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our physics engine delivers next-level ball control, making every shot, pass &amp; deflection feel real. Every action is skill-driven. Like real sports, perfect execution comes from practice, so refine your control, read the play &amp; land the shot when it matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/b1138074f73dfa9c3187b83321030efe.webp?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/2c5e2a3664000686f7539028534a16e1.webp?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/dbf4b553627ee98f7f48029603b3f338.avif?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/471cb68cd77f2edd4e3ee0b4582059c8.poster.avif?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/471cb68cd77f2edd4e3ee0b4582059c8.webm?t=1754224654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/471cb68cd77f2edd4e3ee0b4582059c8.mp4?t=1754224654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull off epic moves like double jumps, wall runs, slides and dashes to outmaneuver opponents. Choose your Striker from a diverse roster, each with unique abilities and movement options that open up new ways to play. Whether you dominate with precision, outthink with strategy, or thrive in pure chaos, there\u2019s a perfect Striker for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/b1138074f73dfa9c3187b83321030efe.webp?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/54cb96554ed8078d9c0928c7cf2eb967.webp?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/d2e0de090ff9e1ae644926e7823b7fa1.poster.avif?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/d2e0de090ff9e1ae644926e7823b7fa1.webm?t=1754224654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/d2e0de090ff9e1ae644926e7823b7fa1.mp4?t=1754224654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win your way. Score goals through strategic positioning, precise plays &amp; mastery of your Striker\u2019s unique abilities. Every match is a test of skill, strategy &amp; teamwork - adapt, read the game &amp; you\u2019ll be playing chess while they\u2019ll be playing checkers. In Vector Strike, victory comes from coordination &amp; strategy as a team, not elimination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/b1138074f73dfa9c3187b83321030efe.webp?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/0285b871411ce8546ef4544f7f5703cb.webp?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/746226a0f71d12c9452a99d143411a6e.poster.avif?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/746226a0f71d12c9452a99d143411a6e.webm?t=1754224654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/746226a0f71d12c9452a99d143411a6e.mp4?t=1754224654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vector Strike is best played with friends. Jump into high-energy 4v4 matches solo or with up to three teammates - grind ranked or mess around in private lobbies. Face the world or keep it casual - either way, hit shareable moments &amp; have fun.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/b1138074f73dfa9c3187b83321030efe.webp?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=44 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/f1c1a9da7248b71eaa15699b438f6e72.webp?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Vector Strike to your wishlist, join our Discord community to find people to play with &amp; follow us across our socials! That\u2019s where we\u2019ll drop all the latest updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you on the pitch ;)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash into action with Vector Strike, a competitive experience that blends precision shooting and an infinite skill cap with tense sports gameplay. It\u2019s easy to pick up but endlessly rewarding to master. Teamwork &amp; strategy reign supreme, so grab your squad &amp; score some goals.\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist &amp; join us on our Early Access journey to help shape the future of Vector Strike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/f8efc2623ee325106992405343be3215.webp?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/1a3cddf17c217a9bbdd01a69f364e257.poster.avif?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/1a3cddf17c217a9bbdd01a69f364e257.webm?t=1754224654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/1a3cddf17c217a9bbdd01a69f364e257.mp4?t=1754224654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our physics engine delivers next-level ball control, making every shot, pass &amp; deflection feel real. Every action is skill-driven. Like real sports, perfect execution comes from practice, so refine your control, read the play &amp; land the shot when it matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/b1138074f73dfa9c3187b83321030efe.webp?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/2c5e2a3664000686f7539028534a16e1.webp?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/dbf4b553627ee98f7f48029603b3f338.avif?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/471cb68cd77f2edd4e3ee0b4582059c8.poster.avif?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/471cb68cd77f2edd4e3ee0b4582059c8.webm?t=1754224654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/471cb68cd77f2edd4e3ee0b4582059c8.mp4?t=1754224654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull off epic moves like double jumps, wall runs, slides and dashes to outmaneuver opponents. Choose your Striker from a diverse roster, each with unique abilities and movement options that open up new ways to play. Whether you dominate with precision, outthink with strategy, or thrive in pure chaos, there\u2019s a perfect Striker for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/b1138074f73dfa9c3187b83321030efe.webp?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/54cb96554ed8078d9c0928c7cf2eb967.webp?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/d2e0de090ff9e1ae644926e7823b7fa1.poster.avif?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/d2e0de090ff9e1ae644926e7823b7fa1.webm?t=1754224654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/d2e0de090ff9e1ae644926e7823b7fa1.mp4?t=1754224654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win your way. Score goals through strategic positioning, precise plays &amp; mastery of your Striker\u2019s unique abilities. Every match is a test of skill, strategy &amp; teamwork - adapt, read the game &amp; you\u2019ll be playing chess while they\u2019ll be playing checkers. In Vector Strike, victory comes from coordination &amp; strategy as a team, not elimination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/b1138074f73dfa9c3187b83321030efe.webp?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/0285b871411ce8546ef4544f7f5703cb.webp?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/746226a0f71d12c9452a99d143411a6e.poster.avif?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/746226a0f71d12c9452a99d143411a6e.webm?t=1754224654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/746226a0f71d12c9452a99d143411a6e.mp4?t=1754224654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vector Strike is best played with friends. Jump into high-energy 4v4 matches solo or with up to three teammates - grind ranked or mess around in private lobbies. Face the world or keep it casual - either way, hit shareable moments &amp; have fun.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/b1138074f73dfa9c3187b83321030efe.webp?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=44 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678820/extras/f1c1a9da7248b71eaa15699b438f6e72.webp?t=1754224654\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Vector Strike to your wishlist, join our Discord community to find people to play with &amp; follow us across our socials! That\u2019s where we\u2019ll drop all the latest updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you on the pitch ;)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Vector Strike is where FPS &amp; sports collide in a fast-paced, physics-based 4v4 arena. Master precision shooting, movement and teamwork to outplay opponents and score goals. Whether you're pulling off winning plays with abilities or just having fun with friends, every shot counts.",
